    5. Scatter 7-11 solid-filled rectangle distractors (1x1-3x3) in remaining black space; each must fail the match condition (wrong size or non-border color for that size)
    6. Derive input: replace each stamped template with a solid rectangle of the border color (same bbox), erasing interior detail
